observed = "MarkRound observes time.Since(st) as RoundDuration, but updateRoundStep supplies RoundState.StartTime, which is the height start rather than a per-round start. At successive nonzero rounds the histogram includes all earlier rounds in the same height instead of measuring each completed round."
